WHERE THE CODE CAME FROM

The paths below are under app/src/main/java/com/pd2updater/install/.

File               Source in pd2-launcher     Original source
-----------------  -------------------------  ----------------------------------
CdKeys.kt          src/blizzard/keys.rs       libd2, packages/bnet/src/cdkey.zig
Keystore.kt        src/blizzard/keystore.rs   libd2, packages/bnet/src/keystore.zig
                                              and idea.zig
Mpq.kt             src/blizzard/mpq.rs        Written for pd2-launcher, following
                                              how libd2's formats/mpq reads the
                                              MPQ format
PieceFetcher.kt    src/blizzard/fetch.rs      blizzard-legacy-dl, src/installer.zig
Torrent.kt         src/blizzard/torrent.rs    blizzard-legacy-dl, src/legacy.zig

pd2-launcher: https://github.com/Pocketward/pd2-launcher


CODE FROM PD2-LAUNCHER WITHOUT A STATED LICENSE

These parts also come from pd2-launcher, or follow how it works:

- install/InstallScript.kt, from src/blizzard/script.rs
- install/NativeInstall.kt, from src/blizzard/native.rs
- install/Products.kt, using pins from src/blizzard.rs and
  src/install/adapters.rs
- Pd2Manifest.kt, following src/manifest.rs, src/update.rs and src/audit.rs
- GameLauncher.kt, following src/process.rs

pd2-launcher has no license file at its root. Its src/blizzard folder has the
two licenses reproduced below, but they name only jaenster as copyright holder,
